<title>FRANCE: Traders confirm new Tunisian wheat import tender.</title>
<headline>Traders confirm new Tunisian wheat import tender.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain traders confirmed on Tuesday they had received a tender from Tunisia for 125,000 tonnes of soft wheat to be shipped in July, August and September.</p>
<p>The tender, issued in Tunis overnight, is for the following origins at sellers' option.</p>
<p>			 If EU origin	  If US origin</p>
<p> 25,000 tonnes	1-10 July	     20-30 June</p>
<p> 25,000 tonnes     10-20 July		1-10 July</p>
<p> 25,000 tonnes	1-10 August	   20-30 July</p>
<p> 25,000 tonnes     10-20 August	    1-10 August</p>
<p> 25,000 tonnes     10-20 September	 1-10 September</p>
</text>
